                <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif font-bold text-brand-blue mb-4">The Death of the Faceless Corporation</h2>
                <div class="w-24 h-1.5 bg-brand-gold rounded-full mb-12"></div>
                
                <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10">
