                            <li class="flex items-start gap-4"><i data-lucide="x" class="text-red-400 shrink-0 mt-1"></i> <div><strong>Stiff Language:</strong> Using big, confusing English words that don't connect with everyday people.</div></li>
                            <li class="flex items-start gap-4"><i data-lucide="x" class="text-red-400 shrink-0 mt-1"></i> <div><strong>The Silence Trap:</strong> Believing "my hard work will speak for itself." If you are silent, you are invisible.</div></li>
                        </ul>
