                    <div class="bg-brand-blue p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-2xl text-white relative overflow-hidden transform md:scale-105 border border-brand-gold/20">
                        <div class="absolute -right-10 -bottom-10 opacity-[0.05]"><i data-lucide="fingerprint" class="w-80 h-80"></i></div>
                        <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col h-full">
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-8 text-brand-gold">
                                <i data-lucide="zap" class="w-10 h-10"></i>
                                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold">The New African Trust Economy</h3>
                            </div>
                            <ul class="space-y-6 text-lg flex-grow">
                                <li class="flex items-start gap-4"><i data-lucide="check-circle-2" class="text-brand-gold shrink-0 mt-1"></i> <div><strong>People Buy From People:</strong> In Africa, we buy from people we know and trust. Your face is your best marketing tool.</div></li>
                                <li class="flex items-start gap-4"><i data-lucide="check-circle-2" class="text-brand-gold shrink-0 mt-1"></i> <div><strong>Your Unfair Advantage:</strong> AI can copy your writing, but it can never copy your personal life story and experiences.</div></li>
                                <li class="flex items-start gap-4"><i data-lucide="check-circle-2" class="text-brand-gold shrink-0 mt-1"></i> <div><strong>Founder-Led Business:</strong> When people trust the founder, they automatically trust the business.</div></li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
