                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">Vision</h3>
                        <p class="text-blue-100/80 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">What big change do you want to bring to your community or industry in the next 10 years?</p>
                        <p class="text-xs text-brand-gold font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider border-t border-white/10 pt-4">The "Why"</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-white/5 border border-brand-gold/30 p-8 rounded-3xl backdrop-blur-sm transition-all hover:bg-white/10 hover:-translate-y-2 group">
