                        <p class="text-blue-100/80 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">The rules you live by. Things like community (Ubuntu), honesty, and hard work. What do you stand for?</p>
                        <p class="text-xs text-brand-gold font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider border-t border-white/10 pt-4">The "Heart"</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-white/5 border border-brand-gold/30 p-8 rounded-3xl backdrop-blur-sm transition-all hover:bg-white/10 hover:-translate-y-2 group">
                        <i data-lucide="mic" class="w-12 h-12 text-brand-gold mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"></i>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">Voice</h3>
                        <p class="text-blue-100/80 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">How do you speak? Are you the strict mentor, the encouraging friend, or the bold challenger? Keep it natural.</p>
                        <p class="text-xs text-brand-gold font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider border-t border-white/10 pt-4">The "Tone"</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-white/5 border border-brand-gold/30 p-8 rounded-3xl backdrop-blur-sm transition-all hover:bg-white/10 hover:-translate-y-2 group">
                        <i data-lucide="palette" class="w-12 h-12 text-brand-gold mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"></i>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">Visuals</h3>
                        <p class="text-blue-100/80 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">The specific colors and photo styles you always use, so people instantly recognize you on their timeline.</p>
                        <p class="text-xs text-brand-gold font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider border-t border-white/10 pt-4">The "Look"</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
