                    <div class="flex-1">
                        <span class="text-brand-gold font-bold tracking-widest uppercase mb-2 block">03. Stand Out</span>
                        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif font-bold text-brand-blue mb-6">Create Your Own Lane</h2>
                        <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg mb-8 leading-relaxed">
                            Calling yourself just a "Consultant" means you are competing with millions of people. To charge high prices, you must become the ONLY person who does what you do.
                        </p>
                        
                        <div class="space-y-6">
                            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border-l-4 border-brand-gold">
                                <h4 class="font-bold text-brand-blue text-lg">1. Combine Your Skills</h4>
                                <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Mix two things that usually don't go together. (e.g., Tech Founder + Mental Health Advocate).</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border-l-4 border-brand-gold">
                                <h4 class="font-bold text-brand-blue text-lg">2. Add Your African Story</h4>
                                <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Your background, your struggles, and how you grew up make your brand impossible to copy.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border-l-4 border-brand-gold">
                                <h4 class="font-bold text-brand-blue text-lg">3. Repel Bad Clients</h4>
                                <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">A strong brand will naturally push away people who aren't a good fit. That is a good thing!</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="flex-1 w-full max-w-md mx-auto">
                        <div class="bg-brand-blue rounded-full aspect-square p-12 flex flex-col items-center justify-center relative shadow-2xl border-8 border-white">
                            <!-- Intersecting circles visual -->
