                    </div>

                    <div class="flex-1 bg-white/5 p-8 rounded-3xl border border-[#E1306C]/30 flex flex-col relative overflow-hidden">
                        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 bg-[#E1306C]/20 text-pink-200 text-xs font-bold px-4 py-1 rounded-bl-xl">Step 2: Build Trust</div>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2 flex items-center gap-3"><i data-lucide="coffee" class="text-[#E1306C]"></i> The Living Room</h3>
                        <p class="text-brand-gold font-semibold text-sm mb-6">Instagram Stories, YouTube</p>
                        <p class="text-blue-100 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6 flex-grow">This is where you invite people in. You show your daily life, your mistakes, and your personality. You turn strangers into warm friends.</p>
                        <div class="bg-black/20 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/10 text-xs text-gray-300">
                            <strong>Goal:</strong> Make them feel like they know you personally.
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex items-center justify-center lg:rotate-0 rotate-90">
                        <i data-lucide="arrow-right" class="text-brand-gold w-8 h-8 opacity-50"></i>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex-1 bg-brand-gold/10 p-8 rounded-3xl border-2 border-brand-gold flex flex-col relative overflow-hidden transform lg:scale-105 shadow-2xl">
                        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 bg-brand-gold text-brand-blue text-xs font-bold px-4 py-1 rounded-bl-xl">Step 3: Make Money</div>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2 flex items-center gap-3"><i data-lucide="castle" class="text-brand-gold"></i> Your Castle</h3>
                        <p class="text-brand-gold font-semibold text-sm mb-6">WhatsApp, Website, Emails</p>
                        <p class="text-blue-100 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6 flex-grow">This is the land you own. Having a direct WhatsApp line or an email list means you can reach your true fans anytime, for free. This is where sales happen.</p>
                        <div class="bg-brand-blue p-4 rounded-xl border border-brand-gold/30 text-xs text-white">
                            <strong>Fact:</strong> A WhatsApp list of 1,000 true fans is better than 100k TikTok followers.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
