                        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-brand-gold/20 text-brand-gold rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 border border-brand-gold/30"><i data-lucide="heart" class="w-6 h-6"></i></div>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2">Connect <span class="text-blue-200 text-lg font-normal">(30%)</span></h3>
                        <p class="text-brand-gold font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">Show You Are Human</p>
                        <p class="text-blue-100 text-sm flex-grow leading-relaxed">Share your personal story, your mental health challenges, and your mistakes. People connect with your struggles much more than your successes.</p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="flex-1 bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-lg border border-gray-100 flex flex-col">
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-green-50 text-green-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 border border-green-100"><i data-lucide="shopping-cart" class="w-6 h-6"></i></div>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2">Promote <span class="text-gray-400 text-lg font-normal">(10%)</span></h3>
                        <p class="text-green-600 font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">Ask for the Sale</p>
                        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm flex-grow leading-relaxed">Don't be shy. Clearly tell people what you sell, how it helps them, and how to pay you. If you don't sell, you don't have a business.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Slide 7: Mental Health -->
        <div class="slide bg-brand-blue text-white bg-grid-pattern">
            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-10 w-full">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-6 mb-12">
                    <div class="p-4 bg-brand-gold/20 rounded-2xl"><i data-lucide="brain" class="w-10 h-10 text-brand-gold"></i></div>
                    <div>
                        <span class="text-brand-gold font-bold tracking-widest uppercase mb-1 block">06. Protecting Your Peace</span>
                        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif font-bold">Mental Health & Boundaries</h2>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
                    <div class="md:col-span-7">
                        <p class="text-xl text-blue-100/90 leading-relaxed mb-10 font-light">
                            Looking successful online attracts a lot of pressure—from endless DMs to family "Black Tax." You must protect your mental health to survive.
                        </p>
                        <div class="space-y-8">
                            <div class="flex gap-5">
                                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 border border-white/20"><i data-lucide="shield" class="text-brand-gold w-5 h-5"></i></div>
                                <div>
                                    <h4 class="text-xl font-bold mb-1">Set Strong Boundaries</h4>
                                    <p class="text-blue-100/70 text-sm">Decide what you will never post about (e.g., your kids, your private relationships). You control what the world sees.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex gap-5">
                                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 border border-white/20"><i data-lucide="bandage" class="text-brand-gold w-5 h-5"></i></div>
                                <div>
                                    <h4 class="text-xl font-bold mb-1">Share Scars, Not Open Wounds</h4>
                                    <p class="text-blue-100/70 text-sm">It's good to talk about hard times, but only *after* you have healed and learned from them. Don't bleed on the internet.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex gap-5">
                                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 border border-white/20"><i data-lucide="battery-charging" class="text-brand-gold w-5 h-5"></i></div>
                                <div>
                                    <h4 class="text-xl font-bold mb-1">You Are Not Their Therapist</h4>
                                    <p class="text-blue-100/70 text-sm">When you share your struggles, people will share theirs with you. It can be exhausting. Know when to step away and rest.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="md:col-span-5">
                        <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-white/10 to-transparent p-10 rounded-[2.5rem] border border-brand-gold/30 text-center relative shadow-2xl">
                            <i data-lucide="quote" class="absolute top-6 left-6 w-12 h-12 text-brand-gold/20"></i>
                            <p class="text-2xl font-serif italic mb-8 relative z-10 leading-snug mt-6 text-white">
                                "Being authentic doesn't mean you have to share everything. It just means that whatever you *do* share is 100% honest."
                            </p>
                            <div class="w-12 h-1 bg-brand-gold mx-auto mb-4"></div>
                            <p class="text-brand-gold font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-xs">The Golden Rule</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
